<title>USA: Galoob extends Star Wars license.</title>
<headline>Galoob extends Star Wars license.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galoob Toys Inc said its license to sell toys based on George Lucas' Star Wars trilogy has been extended by Lucasfilm Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;Today, 20 years after the initial release of the films, Star Wars is again the best selling brand of boys' toys in America,&quot; Galoob president and chief executive officer Mark Goldman said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect 1997 will be Galoob's most successful Star Wars year yet, and look forward to continued success with Lucasfilm in the future.&quot;</p>
</text>
